    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's Fight phase or the opponent's Shooting phase, right after a **GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER** model of yours is **destroyed** by an enemy unit. Pick another of your **GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER** models as the target.\n\nUntil the battle ends, for each attack a model of yours from an **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit makes against that enemy unit:\n\n- each **Hit roll** of 1 may be re-rolled\n- any Hit roll may be re-rolled instead, if the slain model is a **MAGUS**, **PRIMUS** or **ACOLYTE ICONWARD**",
